OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry for many, with sunny
OL,6,Fspells. A few showers are possible,
OL,7,Fmainly towards the southwest of the
OL,8,FUK, where they may turn heavy later on
OL,9,Fin the afternoon. Feeling warm in the
OL,10,Fsunshine, with lighter winds in the
OL,11,Fsouth.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FBands of heavy showers and
OL,14,Fthunderstorms will develop and move
OL,15,Fnorthwards across England, Wales and
OL,16,Fperhaps Northern Ireland, though
OL,17,Fsporadic in nature. Scotland probably
OL,18,Fremaining dry. Warm and humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
